{
  "_comment": [
    "PNP dev-baseline packet policy (PEI-598) — the first enforced Peios",
    "firewall policy. The kernel reads Machine\\System\\Network\\Rules whole",
    "at registryd's registration, re-walks on change, and publishes it as a",
    "policy generation; applying this seed flips enforcement ON at boot.",
    "",
    "The compiled-in backstop is DROP, both directions, always (ratified):",
    "every rule below is a visible, deletable permissive statement, per the",
    "doctrine that permissiveness never lives in defaults. Approved by jack",
    "2026-09-01. Rule by rule:",
    "",
    "  outbound-ok       All egress passes — the ratified shipped shape until",
    "                    the connection tier earns outbound strictness.",
    "  established       The stateful cornerstone: replies come home.",
    "  loopback          Localhost is policed like everything else now;",
    "                    every local daemon depends on this rule.",
    "  arp               PNP polices ARP where stock Linux never did; without",
    "                    this, the backstop kills neighbor resolution.",
    "  icmpv6-housekeeping  ND (133-137) and MLD (130-132, 143) ride outside",
    "                    conntrack's establishment model; IPv6 dies quietly",
    "                    without them.",
    "  dhcp-client       OFFER/ACK can arrive as broadcast conntrack will not",
    "                    tie to the DISCOVER's flow.",
    "  dev-viewer-ports  DEV-ONLY: atrium-server (8080) and the pnpd viewer",
    "                    (8081) stay reachable through QEMU hostfwd. Delete",
    "                    the day this baseline grows up.",
    "",
    "Everything else inbound answers to the backstop. No RawPacket key: that",
    "layer ships zero default rules (ratified) and stays permissive.",
    "",
    "Shipped by the kernel package into /usr/share/regim/; inert until an",
    "image names it in [registry] autoapply."
  ],
  "keys": [
    { "path": "Machine\\System" },
    { "path": "Machine\\System\\Network" },
    { "path": "Machine\\System\\Network\\Rules" },
    { "path": "Machine\\System\\Network\\Rules\\Packet" },
    {
      "path": "Machine\\System\\Network\\Rules\\Packet\\outbound-ok",
      "values": [
        { "name": "Direction.Equal", "type": "sz", "data": "out" },
        { "name": "Actions", "type": "multi", "data": ["PASS"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "Machine\\System\\Network\\Rules\\Packet\\established",
      "values": [
        { "name": "FlowState.Equal", "type": "multi", "data": ["established", "related"] },
        { "name": "Actions", "type": "multi", "data": ["PASS"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "Machine\\System\\Network\\Rules\\Packet\\loopback",
      "values": [
        { "name": "Interface.Equal", "type": "sz", "data": "lo" },
        { "name": "Actions", "type": "multi", "data": ["PASS"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "Machine\\System\\Network\\Rules\\Packet\\arp",
      "values": [
        { "name": "EtherType.Equal", "type": "sz", "data": "arp" },
        { "name": "Actions", "type": "multi", "data": ["PASS"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "Machine\\System\\Network\\Rules\\Packet\\icmpv6-housekeeping",
      "values": [
        { "name": "Protocol.Equal", "type": "sz", "data": "icmpv6" },
        { "name": "IcmpType.Equal", "type": "multi", "data": ["130-137", "143"] },
        { "name": "Actions", "type": "multi", "data": ["PASS"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "Machine\\System\\Network\\Rules\\Packet\\dhcp-client",
      "values": [
        { "name": "Protocol.Equal", "type": "sz", "data": "udp" },
        { "name": "SrcPort.Equal", "type": "dword", "data": 67 },
        { "name": "DstPort.Equal", "type": "dword", "data": 68 },
        { "name": "Actions", "type": "multi", "data": ["PASS"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "Machine\\System\\Network\\Rules\\Packet\\dev-viewer-ports",
      "values": [
        { "name": "Direction.Equal", "type": "sz", "data": "in" },
        { "name": "Protocol.Equal", "type": "sz", "data": "tcp" },
        { "name": "DstPort.Equal", "type": "multi", "data": ["8080", "8081"] },
        { "name": "Actions", "type": "multi", "data": ["PASS"] }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
